<time>2026-05-08T14:46:09Z</time>
<name>Cobnor Point to Cobnor House</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Continuing the journey, the path is now surfaced with tarmac. This stretch of the path has especially been made up to allow disabled access. 
]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
